        "text": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Clients kept asking for the look from the last job. The packs here are those looks, rebuilt so they behave on footage I never saw: tested on Sony, Panasonic, Canon, Fujifilm, Blackmagic and Apple Log, and on two phones.</p><p>Every pack has a log and a Rec.709 version, because most people who buy a LUT shoot both.</p>"
